996,"transform":{"position":[-24,-0.15613295089316237,78],"rotation":[0,0.54,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":1,"title":"Raise the obelisk","target":"Click the left-hand obelisk → Program.","steps":[{"cat":"control","text":"repeat 20 times","depth":0},{"cat":"motion","text":"move Y by 0.6 ft","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 0.15 seconds","depth":1}],"tip":"Egyptian crews raised these by hauling them upright onto a base with ropes and sand. Yours cheats and floats. Change 0.6 to 0.1 and watch how much more convincing slow is than fast.","accent":"#c2861f"}},{"id":"e5a87a96-6d1c-46a7-b96a-92674b4f5aeb","createdAt":1786918588000,"transform":{"position":[26,0.06581189047350167,78],"rotation":[0,-0.58,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":2,"title":"Sail the ship of the sun","target":"Click Khufu’s ship → Program.","steps":[{"cat":"control","text":"forever","depth":0},{"cat":"motion","text":"move X by 22 ft","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 2 seconds","depth":1},{"cat":"motion","text":"rotate 180 degrees","depth":1},{"cat":"motion","text":"move X by 22 ft","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 2 seconds","depth":1},{"cat":"motion","text":"rotate 180 degrees","depth":1}],"tip":"move X always slides along the world’s X, never along the way the boat is pointing — so the two rotate blocks are only there to turn the hull to face its direction of travel. Take them out and it sails backwards half the time.","accent":"#7d5044"}},{"id":"0dc69175-e00b-4109-bc28-19aacbb0651d","createdAt":1786918588004,"transform":{"position":[-34,7.944034569469911,44],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"light-orb","color":"#f2a541"},{"id":"5827b790-23e4-40c7-9cf7-94b24e1ac092","createdAt":1786918588008,"transform":{"position":[-34,7.881968902807631,52],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"light-orb","color":"#f2a541"},{"id":"8bcc5a4c-2c0c-4252-b713-f7b771f7267f","cre